+A PR OPENED ON A BLOCKED RUN SAYS PARTIAL PROGRESS IN ITS FIRST LINE.
+BEFORE REPORTING blocked, ASK PER STEP: CAN I DO THIS AT ALL?
+ONE STEP THE AGENT COULD HAVE EXECUTED REJECTS THE CLAIM.
+```
 
